    "chunk_text": "Se \u00e6lmihtiga Wealdend, \u00f0e ne ongann n\u00e6fre, & se \u00f0e ana is so\u00f0 God, gesceop ealle \u00f0ing, gesewenlice & Se is so\u00f0lice lufu \u00f0\u00e6s so\u00f0f\u00e6stan F\u00e6der, & his Suna lufu, & heora begra willa, for \u00f0an \u00f0e hi wylla\u00f0 an. & \u00f0urh \u00f0one Gast syndon so\u00f0lice geliff\u00e6ste ealle \u00f0a gesceafta \u00f0e se F\u00e6der gesceop \u00feurh his \u00d0eos is seo halige \u00f0rynnyss \u00fee ealle \u00feing gesceop, an anre Godcundnysse \u00e6fre wuniende, on anum Englas he gesceop on \u00e6nlicre f\u00e6gernysse, manega \u00f0usenda, on micelre streng\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t hi mihton geseon Hi nabba\u00f0 nanne lichaman, ac hi libba\u00f0 on gaste, ungesewenlice us \u00fee on synnum libba\u00f0. And \u00fea halgan englas, \u00fee on heofenum wunia\u00f0, ne worhton n\u00e6fre nane synne, ne hi syngian ne magon, And hi wurdon \u00f0a awende to awyrgedum deoflum, for \u00f0an \u00f0e hi noldon habban heora Scyppend heom \u00d0a ne mihte he gewunian on \u00f0\u00e6re micclan m\u00e6r\u00f0e, ne eac his gegadan butan Godes mihte, ac wurdon And \u00e6lc \u00fe\u00e6ra yfela \u00f0e on \u00f0issere worulde becym\u00f0, eall hit gewyr\u00f0 \u00e6fre \u00feurh \u00fea awyrgedan gastas, & Witodlice on angynne se \u00e6lmihtiga God ealle \u00f0ing gesceop, heofonas & eor\u00f0an, & ealne middaneard, Ac se mildheorta F\u00e6der, \u00f0e us to mannum gesceop \u00feurh his an",
